## Patterns (shipped)

| Pattern | Spec |
|---------|------|
| Chapter numbers | Large mono `01` + `// Title` |
| Next-preview | `Scroll` / `↓` / next chapter title |
| Overlay nav | Numbered accordion sections (~20px titles); one open at a time |
| Interior pages | `DirectionEPageShell` — `01 // ABOUT` eyebrow + page title + back to `/` |
| Motion | 600–800ms ease `[0.21, 0.47, 0.32, 0.98]`; honor `prefers-reduced-motion` |
| Tokens | `#FFFFFF` · `#181818` · `#5C5C5C` · `#F3EEE7` · Apply `#0A3C2E` only |
| Media | `src/assets/images/gym` (`gymPhotos`) — no shadcnspace CDN |

