## Anti-patterns

- Blue SaaS badges, purple gradients, rounded-full pill clusters
- Odd Ritual product/shop grids
- Dense always-expanded overlay lists (use accordion)
- Public Buy / Reserve / Book in marketing chrome
- Hardcoded Unsplash for facility imagery when gym photos exist
